","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":195,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":90,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dongyuan-e-p030a-q","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-be130afba4e9d8f6ed6f","layer":"pei","quote":"灵帝时榜门卖官，于是太尉段颎、司徒崔烈、太尉樊陵、司空张温之徒，皆入钱，上千万，下五百万，以买三公。","attribution":"《傅子》","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":115,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-2584e332007810716e08","start":10,"end":60,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dongyuan-q-o033","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-7f9d355b395577aab159","layer":"original","quote":"绍既斩宦者所署司隶校尉〔樊陵、河南尹〕许相〖13〗；遂勒兵捕诸阉人，无少长皆杀之；或有无须而误死者；至自发露形体而后得免。宦者或有行善自守而犹见及〖14〗，其滥如此，死者二千余人。急追珪等，珪等悉赴河死。帝得还宫。","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":195,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":107,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dongyuan-q-p030","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-be130afba4e9d8f6ed6f","layer":"pei","quote":"灵帝时榜门卖官，于是太尉段颎、司徒崔烈、太尉樊陵、司空张温之徒，皆入钱，上千万，下五百万，以买三公。颎数征伐有大功，烈有北州重名，温有杰才，陵能偶时；皆一时显士，犹以货取位；而况于刘嚣、唐珍、张颢之党乎！","attribution":"《傅子》","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":115,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-2584e332007810716e08","start":10,"end":112,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
